17592186462408}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "016b340f-7aa5-5001-aeb3-927982c5cf50" :question/math-academy-id "q-104694" :question/problem "Which of the numbers below belong to ${Q}^{-}?$\n- **I.** $47$\n- **II.** $-\\sqrt{12}$\n- **III.** $\\sqrt{10}$\n- **IV.** $0$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "Remember that ${Q}^{-}$ is the set of all negative rational numbers.\n\n- $47$ is positive, not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $-\\sqrt{12}=-2\\sqrt{3}$ is not a rational number, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $\\sqrt{10}$ is positive, not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $0$ is not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"None of those listed\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240914 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to Scripted Special Sets" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049887 :topic/id #uuid "1bbcbfec-d0a8-5419-81c9-b34aaaaaa84f" :topic/math-academy-id 47 :topic/title "Special Sets"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c7fca09-c60e-5692-816b-bc3a56615fb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461311} {:answer/id #uuid "f7b4070d-8621-542a-a0d8-a4eb557bc191" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461312}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f7b4070d-8621-542a-a0d8-a4eb557bc191" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461312} :answer-field/id #uuid