er/id #uuid "8f7dce65-5e9c-54f3-bf6d-f0bdded38c59" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447867} :answer-field/id #uuid "45d468d9-ad9e-5842-b1a1-0d81106ec1a5" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448973} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dc820af5-3c85-57d4-81c4-43eca3e0a851" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447868} {:answer/id #uuid "d8582ad8-c4ee-5cb2-b47f-96766390b92f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc820af5-3c85-57d4-81c4-43eca3e0a851" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447868} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7cdbeab-101c-5f0b-8940-0a457a37d7f7" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448974}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "72b2f218-4463-5051-8c3b-5d02162b5905" :question/math-academy-id "q-107115" :question/problem "Consider the vector space ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$ of all $2\\times 2$ matrices over $R,$  and its subset $D$ containing all $2\\times 2$ matrices such that the sum of all its entries equals $0.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $D$ is closed under matrix addition\n\n- **II.** $D$ is closed under scalar multiplication\n\n- **III.** $D$ is a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$\n\n- **IV.** $D$ is **not** a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that a subset of a vector space is a subspace if it's closed under addition and scalar multiplication.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Suppose ${A}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{1} & {b}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{1} & {d}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}$ and ${A}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{2} & {b}_{2} \\\\ {c}_{2} & {d}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}$ are two matrices from $D.$  then \n\n$$\n{A}_{1}+{A}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{1}+{a}_{2} & {b}_{1}+{b}_{2} \\\\ {c}_{1}+{c}_{2} & {d}_{1}+{d}_{2}\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\n and since \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({a}_{1}+{a}_{2})+({b}_{1}+{b}_{2})+({c}_{1}+{c}_{2})+({d}_{1}+{d}_{2}) & = \\\\ ({a}_{1}+{b}_{1}+{c}_{1}+{d}_{1})+({a}_{1}+{b}_{1}+{c}_{1}+{d}_{1}) & = \\\\ 0+0 & = \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe can conclude that ${A}_{1}+{A}_{2}$ also belongs to $D.$ So, $D$ is closed under addition.\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, suppose $A=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{bmatrix}\\in D$ and let $\\alpha \\in R.$ Then \n\n$$\n\\alpha A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\alpha a & \\alpha b \\\\ \\alpha c & \\alpha d\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\n and so\nthe sum of the entries of $\\alpha A$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\alpha a+\\alpha b+\\alpha c+\\alpha d & =\\alpha (a+b+c+d) \\\\  & =\\alpha \\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $D$ is closed under scalar multiplication.\n\n- Statement III is true, while statement IV is false. $D$ is a subspace because it's closed under addition and scalar multiplication.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244025 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124590 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8f306cf2-6881-5948-90bd-4e0ce98b4116" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Subspaces of Matrix Vector Spaces" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050453 :topic/id #uuid "4a436386-bf41-55c7-b1d3-02adad8f3faf" :topic/math-academy-id 1907 :topic/title "Subspaces of Abstract Vector Spaces"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b0eb038c-5b51-5d7c-bdf5-f61c5f197752" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447870} {:answer/id #uuid "971fa534-d27a-5df8-a351-be678116035b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "971fa534-d27a-5df8-a351-be678116035b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447871} :answer-field/id #uuid "40fcbc27-f09e-5d13-b63b-a3bfac864c91" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448975} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ba547b1-a183-561a-904b-acf399df45c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447872} {:answer/id #uuid "3477959e-ae28-590c-8534-0de29bece5aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447873}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3477959e-ae28-590c-8534-0de29bece5aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447873} :answer-field/id #uuid "d27d2a30-f6b5-5889-b3e8-3a1ab661f5a8" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448976} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3d226a48-bc9a-5c4f-b777-3375deb35e36" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447874} {:answer/id #uuid "5bd9c72e-2a23-5a4f-a198-740e3160f17e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447875}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5bd9c72e-2a23-5a4f-a198-740e3160f17e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447875} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ab34820-b3b2-5e7d-b74b-405abb292421" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448977} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3976bf87-6856-55b9-92ed-31a90b18feea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447876} {:answer/id #uuid "c2f9c511-78a7-51fe-b700-8504529e7988" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447877}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3976bf87-6856-55b9-92ed-31a90b18feea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447876} :answer-field/id #uuid "66584c33-4333-5200-8df1-e753f58cf7e7" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448978}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f3b977ec-88a0-5b97-96bf-4f197129ba2d" :question/math-academy-id "q-107119" :question/problem "Consider the vector space ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$ of all $2\\times 2$ matrices over $R,$  and its subset $T$ containing all $2\\times 2$ matrices of the form $\\begin{bmatrix}a & b \\\\ 0 & c\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $T$ is closed under matrix addition\n- **II.** $T$ is closed under scalar multiplication\n- **III.** $T$ is a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$\n- **IV.** $T$ is **not** a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that a subset of a vector space is a subspace if it's closed under addition and scalar multiplication.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. If ${A}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{1} & {b}_{1} \\\\ 0 & {c}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}$ and ${A}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{1} & {b}_{1} \\\\ 0 & {c}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}$ are two matrices from $T,$  then \n\n$$\n{A}_{1}+{A}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}{a}_{1}+{a}_{2} & {b}_{1}+{b}_{2} \\\\ 0 & {c}_{1}+{c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n \nis also an element of $T.$ So, $T$ is closed under addition.\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, if $A=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b \\\\ 0 & c\\end{bmatrix}\\in T$ and $\\alpha \\in R,$ then \n\n$$\n\\alpha A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\alpha a & \\alpha b \\\\ 0 & \\alpha c\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nalso belongs to $T.$ So, $T$ is closed under scalar multiplication.\n\n- Statement III is true, while statement IV is false. $T$ is a subspace because it's closed under addition and scalar multiplication.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III only.\"" :step/_content [{:activity/_steps {:activity/title "Quiz 1" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045460 :db/ident :activity.type/assessment} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531933} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532758} {:activity/_steps {:activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050453 :topic/id #uuid "4a436386-bf41-55c7-b1d3-02adad8f3faf" :topic/math-academy-id 1907 :topic/title "Subspaces of Abstract Vector Spaces"} :activity/title "Subspaces of Abstract Vector Spaces" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186560356} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561100}]} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244029 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124592 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "2588e089-4786-5346-b42d-65c2740ae2ab" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements About Sets of Vectors in a Polynomial Vector Space" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048552 :topic/id #uuid "a92f5097-81a3-51a2-90e4-397763d967f0" :topic/math-academy-id 1909 :topic/title "Bases in Abstract Vector Spaces"}]}] :question/answer-fields 